msgid "Dock for the masses"
msgstr "Árees d'anclaxe pa les mases"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.latte-dock.appdata.xml.cmake:7
msgid ""
"Latte is a dock based on plasma frameworks that provides an elegant and"
" intuitive experience for your tasks and plasmoids. It animates its contents"
" by using parabolic zoom effect and tries to be there only when it is needed."
msgstr ""
"Latte ye un área d'anclaxe basáu nos frameworks de Plasma qu'apurren una"
" esperiencia elegante ya intuitiva pa xeres y plasmoides. Anima'l so conteníu"
" usando l'efeutu de zoom parabólicu y tenta d'amosase namái cuando se precisa."

